

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:4
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_14742abf:

    # "Approaching the tavern, I suddenly caught the scent of a strange aroma, like wildflowers that made me stop and turn to look around."
    "走向酒馆时，我突然闻到一股奇异芳香，如同野花般的气息让我停下脚步环顾四周。"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:5
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_5d368305:

    # BLACK "{i}Mate... A good potential mate is near...{/i}"
    BLACK "{i}伴侣...优质的潜在伴侣就在附近...{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:7
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_86a5ea2e:

    # "Looking around, I once again took a deep breath, and my eyes naturally drew the beauty heading in the opposite direction of me."
    "环视四周时，我再次深吸一口气，目光不由自主地被那位与我相向而行的美人吸引。"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:8
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_f19d39bc:

    # "Aristocratic, she wore a beautiful blue dress and bonnet hat that elegantly conveyed a sense of class and sensuality."
    "她气质高贵，身着蓝色长裙配软帽，优雅地透露出阶级感与性感魅力。"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:9
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_544fac9c:

    # "Her face was soft, with long auburn brown hair that flowed with some of the bluest eyes I'd ever seen."
    "面容柔美，赤褐色长发如瀑，眼眸是我见过最澄澈的蓝。"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:11
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_3c0eb2fc:

    # BLACK "(We should follow her...)"
    BLACK "(我们应该跟上她...)"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:12
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_7f781590:

    # MC "(I... No, I have to meet 马库斯.)"
    MC "(我...不行，我得去见马库斯。)"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:14
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_f5c76856:

    # MC "(I need to stay focused on things... talk to him first before anything else.)"
    MC "(必须专注正事...其他事先放放，得和他谈谈。)"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:15
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_56f195ef:

    # BLACK "(I will keep her scent for as long as I can to track her...)"
    BLACK "(我会尽力记住她的气息以便追踪...)"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:16
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_ddc022fb:

    # MC "(You can do that?)"
    MC "(你能做到？)"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:17
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_d33bd2a7:

    # BLACK "(Of course, there are many things you will have to learn.)"
    BLACK "(当然，你还有很多要学的。)"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:18
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_5cc5173a:

    # MC "(...)"
    MC "(...)"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:25
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_59fae255:

    # MARKUS "Over here, I have a table for us."
    MARKUS "这边，我占了张桌子。"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:27
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_391745f2:

    # "Sitting at the table with 马库斯, we ordered a round of Ale over and sat back talking about the things that had happened."
    "与马库斯对坐桌边，我们点了麦酒后开始谈论近况。"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:28
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_3a3ca78b:

    # "马库斯 seemed jovial, elated even with everything going on, grinning merrily as he talked about his plans for the future, whereas I remained much more... {i}reserved.{/i}"
    "马库斯显得兴致高昂，纵使经历种种仍眉飞色舞地畅谈未来计划，而我却显得...{i}拘谨许多{/i}。"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:34
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_bd1d77d0:

    # MARKUS @ smile "This is perfect for us!"
    MARKUS @ smile "这局面对我们再好不过了！"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:35
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_1ba1cd79:

    # MARKUS "All we need to do is write a few speeches, smile and wave at some drunks in a tavern or two and make sure to visit a brothel once or twice in the meanwhile!"
    MARKUS "只需写几篇演讲稿，对酒馆醉汉陪笑招手，顺便逛一两回妓院就够了！"

# game/data/world_events/markus_tavern_post_faw/scr.rpy:36
translate zh ev_markus_tavern_ae75d1f4:

    # MC @ talk "Somehow, I don't think everything is going to be quite as easy as you think."
